<title>USA: Hamdoon says Iraq price formula likely on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Hamdoon says Iraq price formula likely on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi envoy to the United Nations Nizar Hamdoon said Monday that Iraq will likely submit a pricing formula for resuming &quot;oil-for-food&quot; oil sales on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hamdoon, speaking with Reuters, said Iraq sees no delays in implementing the second round of oil accord sales now that U.N. Secretary-General Kofi Annan has approved a new aid distribution plan.</p>
<p>&quot;The pricing formula will be submitted very soon, it is possible for Tuesday. I do not expect any delays,&quot; said Hamdoon.</p>
</text>
